@startuml
participant "OZO Platform\n(Team A)" as TeamA
participant "FHIR API" as FHIR
participant "OZO Platform\n(Team B)" as TeamB

== Thread Creation (Team A initiates) ==
TeamA -> FHIR : Create CommunicationRequest\n(status: 'active')\nrequester/sender = Practitioner A1\nextension[senderCareTeam] = CareTeam A\nrecipient = CareTeam B, CareTeam A
FHIR -> FHIR : Create Tasks\nCareTeam B members: 'requested'\nCareTeam A members: 'completed'\n(sender's team)
FHIR -> TeamB : Notify\n[Via Subscription, empty payload]
TeamB -> FHIR : Fetch CommunicationRequest
note over TeamB : Thread appears in\nTeam B's shared inbox

== Reply from Team B ==
TeamB -> FHIR : Create Communication\nsender = Practitioner B1\npartOf = CommunicationRequest\n(no recipient on Communication)
FHIR -> FHIR : Resolve recipient CareTeams\nsender's team = CareTeam B
FHIR -> FHIR : Update Tasks\nCareTeam A members: 'requested'\nfocus = new Communication
FHIR -> FHIR : Complete Tasks\nfor other CareTeam B members\n(team-wide read)
FHIR -> TeamA : Notify\n[Via Subscription, empty payload]
TeamA -> FHIR : Fetch Communication
note over TeamA : New message in\nTeam A's shared inbox

== Follow-up from Different Team A Member ==
TeamA -> FHIR : Create Communication\nsender = Practitioner A2\n(different team member)\npartOf = CommunicationRequest
FHIR -> FHIR : Resolve recipient CareTeams\nsender's team = CareTeam A
FHIR -> FHIR : Update Tasks\nCareTeam B members: 'requested'\nfocus = new Communication
FHIR -> FHIR : Complete Tasks\nfor other CareTeam A members\n(team-wide read)
FHIR -> TeamB : Notify\n[Via Subscription, empty payload]
TeamB -> FHIR : Fetch Communication

== Read Receipt ==
TeamB -> FHIR : Create AuditEvent\n(type: iso-21089-lifecycle 'access', action: 'R')\nagent = Practitioner B1
FHIR -> FHIR : Complete Tasks\nfor all CareTeam B members\n(team-wide read)
note over FHIR : Message marked as read\nfor all CareTeam B members
FHIR -> TeamA : Notify Task update\n[Via Subscription, empty payload]
TeamA -> FHIR : Fetch Task
note over TeamA : Message shown as\nread by Team B
@enduml
